    {
      "category": "General",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "The way it was originally implemented was hacky and fragile. Rewrote it to be more robust."
    },
    {
      "category": "General",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fixed contact hologram flickering when an NPC with customized colors was used."
    },
    {
      "category": "General",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fixed contact appearance sometimes not updating when first logging in or zoning."
    },
    {
      "category": "General",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fixed contact appearance sometimes not immediately reverting when quitting the TF."
    },
    {
      "category": "General",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fixed contact dialog headshot for color-customized NPCs not reflecting the custom colors."
    },
    {
      "category": "General",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "AE contact costumes are now refreshed clientside only when it needs to change instead of every frame."
    },
    {
      "category": "General",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Removed unneeded network traffic constantly sending the name of the arc contact in every entity update."
    },
    {
      "category": "General",
      "subsection": "Badges",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "This change is due to many arcs, including all Incarnate Arcs and SSAs, not giving any merit rewards by default, instead putting them behind a Reward Choice which doesn't trigger the badge."
    },
    {
      "category": "General",
      "subsection": "Badges",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Story arc merit reward payouts will be revised in January once we're back from the holiday break, and the limitation will be put back in to exclude non-combat and Personal Story arcs."
    },
